<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-061" chapter-id="c-jinshu-061-liudan" source-id="s-jinshu-061-liudan-ws7903772">
  <p id="c-jinshu-061-liudan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-061-liudan:p001:m0000" ref="mc1_08w_r6l">耽</persName>字敬道。少有行檢，以義尚流稱，為宗族所推。博學，明習《詩》、《禮》、三史。曆度支尚書，加散騎常侍。在職公平廉慎，所蒞著績。<persName id="c-jinshu-061-liudan:p001:m0062" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF">桓玄</persName>，<persName id="c-jinshu-061-liudan:p001:m0065" ref="mc1_08w_r6l">耽</persName>女婿也。及<persName id="c-jinshu-061-liudan:p001:m0071" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF">玄</persName>輔政，以<persName id="c-jinshu-061-liudan:p001:m0076" ref="mc1_08w_r6l">耽</persName>為尚書令，加侍中，不拜，改授特進、金紫光祿大夫。尋卒，追贈左光祿大夫、開府。<persName id="c-jinshu-061-liudan:p001:m0115" ref="mc1_08w_r6l">耽</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-061-liudan:p001:m0117" ref="5y0_bxq_0ur">柳</persName>。</p>
</text>
